Source: kolibri-archive-keyring
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Learning Equality <info@learningequality.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://learningequality.org/kolibri

Package: kolibri-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Kolibri APT repository configuration and signing key
 Configures the Kolibri self-hosted APT repository on
 apt.learningequality.org by installing its deb822 source file and the
 archive signing key used to verify its packages.
 .
 Installing this package lets apt fetch and upgrade Kolibri packages from
 the canonical Kolibri APT repository without manually adding a source line.
